```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Service as UserProfileService
    participant Cache as CacheService
    participant EventBus
    participant AuditLog

    Client->>Service: createProfile(request)
    Service->>Service: validateProfile()
    Service->>Service: checkUsernameAvailability()
    Service->>Service: create profile entity
    Service->>Cache: set(profileKey, profile)
    Service->>AuditLog: log(CREATE action)
    Service->>EventBus: emit(PROFILE_CREATED event)
    Service-->>Client: return profile

    Client->>Service: getProfile(userId)
    Service->>Cache: get(profileKey)
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>Service: return cached profile
    else Cache Miss
        Service->>Service: retrieve from storage
        Service->>Cache: set(profileKey, profile)
    end
    Service-->>Client: return profile

    Client->>Service: updateProfile(userId, updates)
    Service->>Service: validateProfile()
    Service->>Service: apply updates
    Service->>Cache: delete(old cache keys)
    Service->>AuditLog: log(UPDATE action)
    Service->>EventBus: emit(PROFILE_UPDATED event)
    Service-->>Client: return updated profile

    Client->>Service: uploadAvatar(request)
    Service->>Service: validate image
    Service->>Service: process with sharp
    Service->>Service: update profile
    Service->>Cache: invalidate caches
    Service->>AuditLog: log(AVATAR_UPLOAD action)
    Service->>EventBus: emit(AVATAR_UPLOADED event)
    Service-->>Client: return avatar metadata
```
